---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import ArticleSchema from "../../components/schema/ArticleSchema.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import FAQSchema from "../../components/schema/FAQSchema.astro";

const tableOfContents = [
  { id: "intro", label: "Introduction" },
  { id: "tool-vs-service", label: "Tool vs. service" },
  { id: "comparison-table", label: "Comparison table" },
  { id: "probo", label: "1. Probo" },
  { id: "vanta", label: "2. Vanta" },
  { id: "drata", label: "3. Drata" },
  { id: "secureframe", label: "4. Secureframe" },
  { id: "scytale", label: "5. Scytale" },
  { id: "sprinto", label: "6. Sprinto" },
  { id: "thoropass", label: "7. Thoropass" },
  { id: "framework-quiz", label: "Which framework?" },
  { id: "decision-tree", label: "Which should you pick?" },
  { id: "faq", label: "FAQ" },
  { id: "related-reading", label: "Related reading" },
];

const faqs = [
  {
    question: "What is the best Vanta alternative for a startup?",
    answer:
      "Probo, if you want the work done for you: a dedicated compliance officer runs your program on an open-source platform, from $10,000 for the year, platform and service included. If you have in-house security and want a self-serve tool, look at Drata or Secureframe.",
  },
  {
    question: "Is there an open-source alternative to Vanta?",
    answer:
      "Yes. Probo is open source on GitHub and free to self-host, with no vendor lock-in.",
  },
  {
    question: "What is the cheapest Vanta alternative?",
    answer:
      "Probo self-hosted is free, and the platform alone is also available on Probo Cloud. With a dedicated compliance officer, it starts at $10,000 for the year, platform and service included, depending on the size of your team. Vanta typically costs $15,000 to $25,000 a year before any consultants.",
  },
  {
    question: "Which Vanta alternative works with AI agents?",
    answer:
      "Probo. Every record is available through a full GraphQL API, an MCP server with 400+ tools and the prb CLI, so Claude, ChatGPT or Cursor can work on your compliance together with your team.",
  },
  {
    question: "How fast can I get audit-ready with Probo?",
    answer:
      "It depends on your setup. A small team with a standard stack can be audit-ready in 2 to 4 weeks, because a compliance officer does the work and follows up with you on the gaps. You don't have to work out on your own whether you're ready to book the audit, how to book it or what the auditor will ask.",
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title={"7 Vanta Alternatives in 2026: Honest Comparison"}
  description={"Honest comparison of 7 Vanta alternatives for compliance automation. Probo is the only open-source option with a dedicated compliance officer included, built for AI agents with GraphQL, MCP and a CLI."}
>
  <ArticleSchema
    title="Vanta Alternatives in 2026: 7 Platforms Compared Honestly (Including a Free One)"
    description="Honest comparison of 7 Vanta alternatives for compliance automation. Probo is the only open-source, free-tier option with a dedicated compliance officer included, built for AI agents with GraphQL, MCP and a CLI."
    url="https://www.probo.com/hub/vanta-alternatives-2026"
    image="https://www.probo.com/og.png"
    datePublished="2026-04-23"
    dateModified="2026-11-09"
  />
  <FAQSchema faqs={faqs} />
  <main class="container my-10 sm:my-20">
    <Breadcrumbs
      items={[
        { label: "Hub", href: "/hub" },
        { label: "Vanta alternatives in 2026" },
      ]}
      class="mb-6"
    />
    <header class="mx-auto mb-12 max-w-[900px] text-center sm:mb-16">
      <h1
        class="text-foreground mb-6 text-[2.5rem] leading-[1.1] font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] sm:text-[3.5rem]"
      >
        <span class="highlight-text">{"Vanta alternatives"}</span>
        {" in 2026"}
        <br />
        {"7 platforms compared honestly (including a free one)"}
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg">
        {
          "Honest comparison of 7 Vanta alternatives for compliance automation. Probo is the only open-source, free-tier option with a dedicated compliance officer included, and it is built for AI agents to work on your compliance with your team."
        }
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:flex-row lg:gap-16">
      <aside class="shrink-0 lg:w-56">
        <nav class="lg:sticky lg:top-24">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
            {
              tableOfContents.map((item) => (
                <button
                  type="button"
                  data-section={item.id}
                  class="toc-link cursor-pointer border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-left text-sm leading-5 text-[#6b716a] transition-colors hover:text-[#141e12]"
                >
                  {item.label}
                </button>
              ))
            }
          </div>
        </nav>
      </aside>

      <article class="max-w-[720px] flex-1">
        <section id="intro" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Short answer:"}</strong>
              {
                " for a startup that needs SOC 2 or ISO 27001 without a compliance person on staff, the best Vanta alternative is Probo: an open-source platform plus a dedicated compliance officer from $10,000 for the year, built for AI agents with GraphQL, MCP and a CLI. If you already have a security team and want a self-serve tool, Drata and Secureframe are the closest alternatives."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                'You just got the email from your biggest prospect\'s security team. "Please complete the attached vendor security questionnaire and provide your SOC 2 report."'
              }
            </p>
            <p>{"You don't have a SOC 2 report."}</p>
            <p>
              {
                'So you start researching compliance platforms. Vanta is everywhere. Every Y Combinator batch mentions it. Every "how we got SOC 2" blog post features it. You sign up for a demo, get quoted $15,000+/year, and realize: you still have to do all the work yourself.'
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <em>{"That's the part nobody tells you upfront."}</em>
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "Vanta is a dashboard. It plugs into hundreds of integrations that pull far more evidence than an auditor needs, and hands you template policies and the same control set it gives every customer. At the end of the day, you're the one adapting those templates, mapping controls, chasing your team for access reviews, and figuring out what the auditor actually wants."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "For a 200-person company with a dedicated security team, that's fine. For a 15-person startup trying to close its first enterprise deal, that's a full-time job nobody budgeted for."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "This article compares 7 Vanta alternatives honestly. No affiliate rankings. No \"they're all great!\" hedging. We'll tell you who each platform is actually built for, what it costs, and where it falls short."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Disclosure:"}</strong>
              {
                " Probo publishes this page and sells one of the options below. Probo comes first because it is the only option that combines an open-source platform, a dedicated compliance officer and native access for AI agents. For every other platform, we say who it fits better than Probo."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="tool-vs-service" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"The real question: tool vs. service"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {
                "Before we compare platforms, let's reframe the decision most founders get wrong."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  'The question isn\'t "which compliance automation tool should I buy?"'
                }</strong
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{
                  'The question is: "Do I need a tool, or do I need someone to do the work?"'
                }</strong
              >
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "Most compliance platforms sell you software and assume you have someone internally who knows what to do with it. That's a massive assumption. If you don't have a compliance person on staff, buying a compliance tool is like buying a professional camera and expecting it to make you a photographer."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "Some of the platforms below give you the camera. One of them sends you the photographer."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {"Keep that distinction in mind as you read."}
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="comparison-table" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"The comparison table"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              {
                "Here's the honest side-by-side. We scored each platform on five criteria that actually matter when you're evaluating alternatives to Vanta."
              }
            </p>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full border-collapse text-sm">
                <thead>
                  <tr class="border-border-low border-b">
                    <th
                      class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 text-left font-semibold"
                      >{"Platform"}</th
                    >
                    <th
                      class="text-foreground px-2 py-3 text-left font-semibold"
                      >{"Starting Price"}</th
                    >
                    <th
                      class="text-foreground px-2 py-3 text-left font-semibold"
                      >{"Open Source"}</th
                    >
                    <th
                      class="text-foreground px-2 py-3 text-left font-semibold"
                      >{"Human Expert Included"}</th
                    >
                    <th
                      class="text-foreground px-2 py-3 text-left font-semibold"
                      >{"You Do the Work"}</th
                    >
                    <th
                      class="text-foreground py-3 pl-2 text-left font-semibold"
                      >{"Best For"}</th
                    >
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr class="border-border-low border-b bg-[#f0f7e4]">
                    <td class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 font-medium"
                      >{"Probo"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">
                      {"Free (self-hosted) / from $10K/yr (platform + service)"}
                    </td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"✅ Yes"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">
                      {"✅ Dedicated compliance officer"}
                    </td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"No — they do it"}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 pl-2">
                      {"Startups that want compliance done, not managed"}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="border-border-low border-b">
                    <td class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 font-medium"
                      >{"Vanta"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"~$15K–$25K/yr"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌ (partner network)"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Yes"}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 pl-2">
                      {"Mid-market teams with in-house security"}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="border-border-low border-b">
                    <td class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 font-medium"
                      >{"Drata"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"~$15K–$22K/yr"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌ (partner network)"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Yes"}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 pl-2">
                      {"Companies wanting strong automation + GRC"}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="border-border-low border-b">
                    <td class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 font-medium"
                      >{"Secureframe"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Custom (quote-based)"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Yes"}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 pl-2">
                      {"Teams needing federal/DoD compliance (CMMC)"}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="border-border-low border-b">
                    <td class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 font-medium"
                      >{"Scytale"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Custom (quote-based)"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"✅ Optional consulting bundles"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Partially"}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 pl-2">
                      {
                        "Startups wanting a bundle (platform + pen test + consulting)"
                      }
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="border-border-low border-b">
                    <td class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 font-medium"
                      >{"Sprinto"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Custom (quote-based)"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Yes"}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 pl-2">
                      {"Budget-conscious teams outside the US"}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td class="text-foreground py-3 pr-4 font-medium"
                      >{"Thoropass"}</td
                    >
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Custom (quote-based)"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"❌"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"✅ In-house auditors"}</td>
                    <td class="px-2 py-3">{"Partially"}</td>
                    <td class="py-3 pl-2">
                      {"Companies wanting audit + platform in one vendor"}
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="probo" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"1. Probo: compliance done for you, built for AI agents"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"What it is:"}</strong>
              {
                " An open-source compliance platform backed by Y Combinator, with an optional full-service tier where a dedicated compliance officer runs your entire program."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground"
                >{"Why it's first on this list:"}</strong
              >
              {
                " Probo is the only platform here that you can deploy for free today and self-host. It's also the only one where, if you choose the managed plan, a real compliance officer writes your policies, talks to your auditor, and handles evidence collection for you."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                "That's not a chatbot. That's not a \"partner network\" you get referred to. That's a person assigned to your company who manages the entire lifecycle."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Built for AI agents:"}</strong>
              {
                " Probo is designed so AI agents can work on your compliance program together with your team and your compliance officer. Everything is available through a full "
              }
              <a
                href="/docs/developers/graphql"
                class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline">{"GraphQL API"}</a
              >{", an "}
              <a
                href="/docs/developers/api/mcp/overview"
                class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline">{"MCP server"}</a
              >
              {
                " with 400+ tools (Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, VS Code and more) and the "
              }
              <a
                href="/docs/developers/cli/overview"
                class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline">{"prb CLI"}</a
              >{
                ". An agent can review risks and controls, draft policies, answer security questionnaires or update vendor reviews, always within the permissions of the person who connected it."
              }
            </p>
            <figure class="my-8">
              <img
                src="/ai-agents/hero-ai-agents.svg"
                alt="An AI assistant connected to Probo creates a risk and assigns a remediation task from a chat conversation"
                width="1146"
                height="786"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="border-border-low h-auto w-full rounded-lg border"
              />
              <figcaption
                class="text-muted-foreground mt-3 text-center text-sm"
              >
                {
                  "An AI assistant creating a risk and a task in Probo through MCP. "
                }<a
                  href="/products/ai-agents-for-compliance"
                  class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
                  >{"See AI agents in Probo"}</a
                >
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"What you actually get:"}</strong
              >
            </p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Open-source self-hosted tier:"}</strong
                  >
                  {
                    " Framework tracking (SOC 2, ISO 27001, GDPR, HIPAA, and more), automated evidence collection, community support. Free. Forever. No vendor lock-in."
                  }
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Platform + service (from $10,000/year):"}</strong
                  >
                  {
                    " The Probo platform plus a dedicated compliance officer for the year, priced on the size of your team: gap assessment, risk analysis, vendor reviews, custom policies, audit prep and representation."
                  }
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-foreground"
                    >{"Enterprise (custom):"}</strong
                  >
                  {
                    " Bring your own cloud, forward-deployed compliance engineer, custom frameworks, physical presence during audits."
                  }
                </span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <figure class="my-8">
              <img
                src="/access-review/hero-access-review.svg"
                alt="Probo access review screen listing user accounts from HubSpot and Slack with their admin, MFA and SSO status"
                width="1146"
                height="786"
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
                class="border-border-low h-auto w-full rounded-lg border"
              />
              <figcaption
                class="text-muted-foreground mt-3 text-center text-sm"
              >
                {"An access review in the Probo platform. "}<a
                  href="/products/access-review"
                  class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
                  >{"See access reviews"}</a
                >
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Time to audit-ready:"}</strong>
              {
                " It depends on your setup. A small team with a standard stack can be ready in 2 to 4 weeks, because experts do the work and follow up with you, instead of you learning a new tool and guessing whether you're ready to book the audit."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"The honest downside:"}</strong>
              {
                " Probo is built for startups and SMBs. If you're a 2,000-person enterprise running 15 frameworks across global subsidiaries, you'll outgrow the current offering. They're scaling fast, but the sweet spot today is teams under 500 people."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Frameworks:"}</strong>
              {
                " SOC 2 (Type 1 & 2), SOC 3, ISO 27001, ISO 27701, ISO 42001, GDPR, HIPAA, CCPA, FERPA, CASA."
              }
            </p>
            <blockquote
              class="border-border-low my-8 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#5d770d] bg-[#f8f9f7] p-6 not-italic"
            >
              <p class="text-foreground leading-relaxed">
                <em>
                  {
                    '"We worked with Vanta in the past and didn\'t like the experience, but switching to Probo was night and day."'
                  }
                </em>
                {" — Pierre de Poulpiquet, Co-founder & CTO at Whaly"}
              </p>
            </blockquote>
            <p>
              {"For a detailed head-to-head, read our full "}
              <a
                href="/hub/probo-vs-vanta"
                class="text-[#5d770d] hover:underline"
                >{"Probo vs Vanta comparison"}</a
              >.
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="vanta" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"2. Vanta: the market leader you're probably comparing against"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"What it is:"}</strong>
              {
                ' The largest compliance automation platform, now positioning itself as an "agentic trust platform" with AI features across policy generation, evidence checks, and questionnaire automation.'
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Who it's actually for:"}</strong
              >
              {
                " Mid-market and enterprise companies (100–5,000 employees) that already have someone internally who understands compliance and needs a tool to manage it at scale."
              }
            </p>
            <p><strong class="text-foreground">{"What you get:"}</strong></p>
            <ul class="ml-0 list-none space-y-3">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-foreground">{"Essentials:"}</strong>
                  {
                    " One compliance framework, AI agent for policy generation, automated evidence collection, trust center, auditor API."
                  }
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-foreground">{"Plus:"}</strong>
                  {
                    " Everything above plus AI-powered questionnaire automation (25/year), access management, expanded AI features."
                  }
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-foreground">{"Professional:"}</strong>
                  {
                    " Questionnaire automation (144/year), risk management, advanced trust center, custom monitoring tests, advanced reporting."
                  }
                </span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-muted-foreground">•</span>
                <span>
                  <strong class="text-foreground">{"Enterprise:"}</strong>
                  {" Fully customizable."}
                </span>
              </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Pricing:"}</strong>
              {
                " Not listed publicly. Expect $15,000–$25,000/year for a startup-sized deployment, scaling higher with headcount and frameworks. Multi-year contracts are common. Vanta doesn't publish prices — you have to sit through a demo to get a quote."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"The honest downside:"}</strong>
              {
                " Vanta gives you the cockpit. You still need to fly the plane. Policy writing, control mapping, auditor communication, evidence gap remediation — all on you. If you're a first-time founder who doesn't know the difference between SOC 2 Type 1 and Type 2, Vanta won't teach you. It'll show you a dashboard full of red indicators and wish you luck."
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              {
                'The "partner network" for additional compliance services means Vanta refers you to external consultants for the actual work. Those consultants cost extra — often $10,000–$50,000 on top of your Vanta subscription.'
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Frameworks:"}</strong>
              {
                " 30+ including SOC 2, ISO 27001, HIPAA, PCI DSS, GDPR, CMMC, and more."
              }
            </p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <hr class="border-border-low mb-12" />

        <section id="drata" class="mb-12 scroll-mt-24">
          <h2
            class="text-foreground mb-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em] sm:text-[1.75rem]"
          >
            {"3. Drata: strong automation, enterprise ambitions"}
          </h2>
          <div class="text-muted-foreground space-y-4 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"What it is:"}</strong>
              {
                ' A compliance automation platform that\'s been pushing hard into enterprise GRC territory. Now brands itself as "The Agentic Trust Management Platform." Trusted by 8,000+ customers.'
              }
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{"Who it's actually for:"}</strong
              >
              {
                " Growth-stage companies (50–1,000 employees) that want deep integrations and are building out a formal security program."
              }
